            "The concept rejects AI as a direct replacement for human intelligence.",
            "This framework is presented as a foundational path for developing trustworthy AI systems."
          ],
          "zh": [
            "AI被明确定义为人类智能的延伸。",
            "该理念驳斥了AI将直接替代人类智能的观点。",
